# DVB-T channel exclude list - one name (or partial name) per line.
# Case-insensitive substring match against the broadcast service name, so
# "QVC" also catches "QVC 2 HD". Matching services are disabled and left
# unmapped (not deleted). "(Internet)" simulcast feeds are excluded
# automatically and don't need to be listed here.
